== Trivia ==
* Tumors are a reference to [[wikipedia:Tumor|abnormal growth of tissues of the same name]], caused by genetic mutations.
* Camillo Jr.'s name is a reference to Kracko Jr., a recurring enemy from the ''Kirby'' series. In appearance he bears resemblance to Kracko, the mature version of Kracko Jr.
* {{dlc|r}} Poofer is a reference to [[thelegendofbumbo:Poofer|the enemy]] from ''The Legend of Bumbo'' with the same name.
* {{dlc|r}} A Planetoid is an [[wikipedia:Minor planet|astronomical object that is neither a planet nor a comet]].

